{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問：「故吾。」荅：「第二月。」問：「不忘著存。」荅：「老僧看他有分。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
